# VIM and NVIM

Vim's config file is stored at ~/.vimrc and packages are stored at ~/.vim.
Nvim's config file is stored at ~/.config/nvim/init.vim.

To use the same config file for both vim/nvim and seperate packages (for when
packages apply to only 1 version) do the following.
1. Symlink ~/.config/nvim to ~/.vim.
2. Symlink ~/.vim/init.vim to ~/.vimrc.

